---
import DesignLayout from "../../../layouts/DesignLayout.astro";
import { landingConcepts } from "../../../lib/landing-concepts";
---

<DesignLayout title="落地页方案对比" gallery>
  <div class="ds-comparison-intro">
    <div>
      <a href="/design/">← 返回设计规范</a><h1>落地页方案</h1><p>
        相同配色，不同表达。两个预览可以分别滚动，打开新页面查看完整效果。
      </p>
    </div><label
      >预览视口 <select class="ds-viewport-select" data-preview-width aria-label="预览视口宽度"
        ><option value="1280">Desktop · 1280</option><option value="768">Tablet · 768</option
        ><option value="390">Mobile · 390</option></select
      ></label
    >
  </div>
  <div class="ds-comparison-grid">
    {
      landingConcepts.map((concept) => (
        <section class="ds-comparison-panel">
          <>
            <div class="ds-comparison-title">
              <>
                <div>
                  <>
                    <span>{concept.title}</span>
                    <h2>{concept.subtitle}</h2>
                  </>
                </div>
                <a
                  href={concept.href}
                  data-preview-link={concept.href}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                >
                  完整预览 ↗
                </a>
              </>
            </div>
            <div class="ds-frame-host" data-frame-host>
              <iframe
                data-preview-frame={concept.href}
                title={`${concept.title}：${concept.subtitle}`}
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
            <p>{concept.description}</p>
          </>
        </section>
      ))
    }
  </div>
  <p class="ds-comparison-note">
    方案 01 是静态视觉参考，界面中的数据为示例。后续方案继续保留独立页面，方便回看。
  </p>
</DesignLayout>
